    "https://www.alfred.edu/jobs-at-alfred/index.cfm": {
      "title": "Jobs at Alfred",
      "description": "Jobs at Alfred | Alfred University Skip To Top Navigation Skip To Content Skip To Footer Apply Visit Request Info Give Search Search alfred.edu Search alfred.edu Menu Close Search alfred.edu Search alfred.edu About show submenu for About Alfred at a Glance History & Traditions Awards & Accolades Our Mission Alfred Community Institutional Research Campus Map Policies Academics show submenu for Academics Undergrad Majors & Minors Graduate Programs Colleges & Schools Off-Campus Programs Academic Support Summer & Winter Terms Academic Calendar Study Abroad Experiential Learning Honors Research Admissions & Aid show submenu for Admissions & Aid Undergraduate Graduate Transfer International Tuition & Fees Affording Alfred Financial Aid Admissions Counselors Student Life show submenu for Student Life Housing & Dining First Year Experience Campus Safety Clubs & Organizations Inclusivity Fitness & Recreation Health & Wellness Career Development Athletics show submenu for Athletics Official AU Saxons Saxon Hill Club & Intramural Sports Facility Hours Spirit Shop Pre-College Programs Information for Prospective Students Accepted Students Families & Parents Visitors Current Students Faculty & Staff Alumni & Friends Research & Business Partners Job Seekers High School Counselors Quick Links Request Info Apply Visit Blog News Events MyAU Directory Give Bookstore Libraries Our Promise Jobs at Alfred Home jobs-at-alfred Jobs at Alfred Back To Home Job Opportunities at Alfred University Opportunities at Alfred University are more than jobs; here at AU we are a community working to provide an incredible education and student experience for every individual we serve. Whether you join our faculty or facilities staff, you will find a place where people work hard and genuinely care about a mission that we can only accomplish together. Explore the list of opportunities below, and apply to join our team and start your own Alfred Experience. Alfred University is committed to an anti-discrimination policy in all of its programs and services. Adminitrative Assistant, CACT Office Location: Alfred, NY Department: CACT Office + View details Assistant Athletic Trainer Location: Alfred, NY Department: Athletics + View details Assistant Dean of Students for Reslife/Wellness Location: Alfred, NY Department: Residential Communities + View details Assistant Director of Accessibility Services Location: Alfred, NY Department: Center for Academic Success + View details AUNY School Counseling Field PLacement Coordinator Location: Alfred, NY Department: School of Graduate and Continuing Studies + View details Barn Assistant Location: Alfred, NY Department: Student Experience + View details Career Coach & Advisor Location: Alfred Department: Career Development + View details Case Manager & Prevention & Education Coordinator Location: Alfred, NY Department: Residential Communities + View details Custodian-Full Time Regular Location: Alfred, NY Department: Facilities Services + View details Custodian-Temporary Location: Alfred, NY Department: Physical Plant + View details Director of Public Safety Location: Alfred, NY + View details Division Secretary, Biology & Biochemistry/Environmental Studies & Geology/Physics & Astronomy Location: Alfred, NY Department: Biology & Biochemistry, CLAS + View details Enrollment Marketing Specialist Location: Alfred, NY Department: Marketing and Communications + View details Environmental, Health & Safety Coordinator (EH&S) Location: Alfred, NY Department: Facilities + View details Financial Analyst Location: Alfred, NY Department: Business and Finance + View details Glass Studio Technician Location: Alfred, NY Department: Sculpture/Dimensional Studies + View details Grounds Keeper Location: Alfred, NY Department: Grounds and Event Services + View details Grounds Keeper Location: Alfred, NY Department: Grounds and Event Services + View details Groundskeeper Projects Location: Alfred, NY Department: Facilities Services + View details HEOP Counselor Location: Alfred, NY Department: Opportunity Programs + View details HR Manager: Benefits, Leave and Compensation Location: Alfred, NY Department: Human Resources + View details HR Specialist, Benefits, Leave & Compliance Training Location: Alfred, NY Department: Human Resources + View details HVAC Mechanic Location: Alfred, NY Department: Facilities + View details Lab Administrator Location: Alfred Department: Biology & Biochemistry, CLAS + View details New Media and Electronic Arts Technician Location: Alfred, NY Department: Expanded Media + View details Part Time Assistant Coach Location: Alfred, NY Department: Athletics + View details Part Time- Temporary Barn Assistant Location: Alfred, NY Department: Equestrian + View details Per Diem Assistant Athletics Trainer Location: Alfred, NY Department: Athletics + View details Per Diem Bus Driver Location: Alfred, NY Department: Motor Pool + View details Per Diem Driver Location: Alfred, NY Department: Motorpool Services + View details Plumber - NYSCC Union Location: Alfred, NY Department: Facilities Services + View details Post-Doctoral Research Associate in Materials ScienceEngineering Location: Alfred, NY Department: School of Engineering + View details Registered Nurse (RN) Location: Alfred, NY Department: Counseling/Wellness Center + View details Research Accountant Location: Alfred, NY Department: Office of Sponsored Programs + View details Senior Institutional Research Analyst Location: Alfred, NY Department: Provost/COO + View details Senior Mental Health Counselor Location: Alfred, NY Department: Wellness Center + View details Senior Shipping & Receiving Clerk, Property Control Location: Alfred, NY Department: Facilities + View details Technical Specialist Location: Alfred, NY Department: CACT + View details Temporary Museum Assistant Location: Alfred, NY Department: Alfred Museum of Ceramic Art + View details Theodore Randall International Chair Location: Alfred, NY Department: School of Art & Design + View details Vice President for Business and Finance/Chief Finacial Officer Location: Alfred, NY Department: Executive + View details Web and Digital Content Specialist Location: Alfred, NY Department: Marketing and Communications + View details Contact Information Alfred University Office of Human Resources Greene Hall Alfred, NY 14802 Email Christine Harris Human Resources Specialist 1 Saxon Drive Alfred, NY 14802 607-871-2111 Maps & Directions Emergency Information Request Info Visit Us Apply Now Top Information For Prospective Students Accepted Students Families & Parents Visitors Current Students Faculty & Staff Alumni & Friends Research & Business Partners Job Seekers High School Counselors Policies Privacy Policy Anti-Discrimination Policy Accessibility Title IX Top Copyright © 2026 Alfred University | Site Map Top"
